2067072720", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908835810_1609332070406053_617154367072578515_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wpAYx3qB6qoQ7kNvwGffUYX&_nc_oc=AdrJnKI-oXrygGRwrKxJYQg2Q0n029Tfw74rhmOnXAdYOAIty34tNDUnb494ssymMww&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSE_jncpekVZEY43Gm5ucGGGa3V1yAo98HCDrYjmpuMGA&oe=6B0B378C"}, {"file_name": "05_captura_04_trabajo_en_altura.png", "id": "1439463175062650", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908835837_1439463178395983_3728718870245242691_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MMaHLsJvkb4Q7kNvwGBauKg&_nc_oc=AdrTvAg1TIEutWsmc5KhiRa1s9RvCXVJHbWtPWkQKGKt9K4X2B00mAK26nZy1CTWF04&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRhqY7oxGFO8zPkdCfI0cs_fSzn9MZfsyoF8LKp1pcOPA&oe=6B0B4059"}, {"file_name": "05_captura_05_entorno.png", "id": "2075508633162306", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908835845_2075508636495639_2804284654640932740_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1ifUyq5RgOAQ7kNvwEEM8ZJ&_nc_oc=AdoRHtNPyCeyujglVQwuGvKmCphxvTgX9Io-NQIqVCQZUap1L67W61wQkqjabu7WUhA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQZPyPb5CzoNwUJlXdUWKWhcv_Aq3WtFbV2daq-3LzGVg&oe=6B0B219C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Aerial Platform VR Instructor", "keywords": ["aerial", "boomlift", "MEWP", "training", "simulator"], "long_description": "# Aerial Platform VR Instructor: Train for the Real Thing Without the Risk\n\n**Aerial Platform VR Instructor** is a professional safety training simulator for operators of articulated telescopic boom lifts (MEWPs) on construction sites and industrial facilities. A virtual instructor guides you step by step, then examines your skills.\n\n### What You'll Learn\n- **PPE:** Helmet, safety boots, high-visibility vest and a fall-arrest harness anchored in the basket.\n- **Pre-Use Inspection:** Chassis, tyres, turret, booms, jib, capacity plate and emergency systems.\n- **Controls:** Ground and basket control panels, speed selector, overload and lockout indicators, emergency stop.\n- **Operation:** Safe basket access, elevation, telescoping, slewing, driving a slalom and stowing the machine.\n- **Real Risks:** Experience unstable ground, ramp descent, overhead power lines, vehicle impact and strong wind at height.\n\n### Modules & Graded Exam\nFollow the full course or jump to any module, then complete the evaluation for a final score\u2014ideal for onboarding and refresher training.\n\n### Built for Training Centres & Companies\n- **Language:** training content in Spanish.\n- **Controls:** Touch controllers.\n- Custom organizational branding available.\n\nTry the free 15-minute demo. Team licenses for companies at vrinstructors.com. Supports training; does not replace formal certification.", "short_description": "Learn to inspect and operate an articulated boom lift safely in VR. Guided modules, real risks at height, graded exam. Training content in Spanish."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1163377486572450", "locale": "es_ES", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Aerial Platform VR Instructor", "keywords": ["plataforma", "elevadora", "PEMP", "formaci\u00f3n", "simulador"], "long_description": "# Aerial Platform VR Instructor: entrena para la realidad sin riesgos\n\n**Aerial Platform VR Instructor** es un simulador profesional de formaci\u00f3n en seguridad para operadores de plataformas elevadoras m\u00f3viles de personal (PEMP) articuladas en obras e industria. Un instructor virtual te gu\u00eda paso a paso y despu\u00e9s eval\u00faa tus habilidades.\n\n### Qu\u00e9 aprender\u00e1s\n- **EPI:** casco, botas de seguridad, chaleco de alta visibilidad y arn\u00e9s antica\u00eddas anclado en la cesta.\n- **Revisi\u00f3n previa:** chasis, neum\u00e1ticos, torreta, brazos, plum\u00edn, placa de capacidades y sistemas de emergencia.\n- **Mandos:** paneles de base y de cesta, selector de velocidad, indicadores de sobrecarga y bloqueo, seta de emergencia.\n- **Manejo:** acceso a la cesta, elevaci\u00f3n, telesc\u00f3pico, giro de torreta, circulaci\u00f3n en eslalon y repliegue.\n- **Riesgos reales:** terreno inestable, descenso por rampa, tendidos el\u00e9ctricos, golpe de un veh\u00edculo y viento en altura.\n\n### M\u00f3dulos y examen con nota\nSigue el curso completo o entra en cualquier m\u00f3dulo y completa la evaluaci\u00f3n con nota: ideal para incorporaciones y reciclaje.\n\n### Pensado para centros de formaci\u00f3n y empresas\n- **Idioma:** contenido formativo en espa\u00f1ol.\n- **Controles:** mandos Touch.\n- Personalizaci\u00f3n con tu marca disponible.\n\nPrueba gratis la demo de 15 minutos. Licencias para empresas en vrinstructors.com. Apoya la formaci\u00f3n; no sustituye la certificaci\u00f3n oficial.", "short_description": "Aprende a revisar y manejar una plataforma elevadora articulada con seguridad en VR. M\u00f3dulos guiados, riesgos reales en altura y examen con nota."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vrinstructors.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://vrinstructors.com/terms-of-service", "publisher_name": "VR INSTRUCTOR", "support_website_url": "https://vrinstructors.com/help", "website_url": "https://www.vrinstructors.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_lang